<title>SYRIA: Syria sells 50,000 T durum wheat to Cypriot firm.</title>
<headline>Syria sells 50,000 T durum wheat to Cypriot firm.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade (GECPT) has sold 50,000 tonnes of hard amber durum wheat to a Cypriot firm at $195 per tonnes, a GECPT official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters the wheat would be delivered between April and May.</p>
</text>
